  "notes": [
    "E&W local_authority_code is the April 2023 LAD code set as published in the December 2024 OA->PARNCP->LAD->Region file (field LAD24CD); the 1 April 2025 Barnsley/Sheffield recode is a vintage-translation follow-up.",
    "E&W region_code is read per OA from the same December 2024 file (RGN24CD); Wales carries the W99999999 sentinel, Scotland S99999999, NI N99999999.",
    "The Ward 2024 file's LAD column is never read; the ITL 2025 file is joined on the April 2023 LAD codes (exact key join, #205 rule).",
    "The ONS LAD->ITL file lists North Ayrshire (S12000021) under two ITL3 rows (TLM20 Arran and Cumbrae first, TLM93 North Ayrshire mainland second); the shared loader keeps the first row, so North Ayrshire carries TLM20, as the ladder's loader did with the January 2021 file. Follow-up: prefer the mainland LAU or an explicit override.",
    "Scotland households are census 2022 occupied households summed from the NRS postcode index (cell-key perturbed)."
  ],
